eeps calm in crisis, understands complicated technology, but also egocentric, communication difficulty, not willing to further education. Compare with B's stress handling and conscientiousness but nasty remarks. A's leadership but show-off and not open to new ideas. D's responsibility but hot temper. So C still strongest overall. So we vote Candidate C.\n\nThus public message: agree with Sarah, note strengths, address concerns, argue why still best.\n\nProceed."}
